# Normalize to LF everywhere (dart format, shell scripts and CI on Linux/macOS
# all expect LF; Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise get
# CRLF and break `tool/*.sh`).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
